        "eng": "Rainy Cocoa",
        "jpn": "雨色ココア"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "An ordinary college student, Aoi Tokura, was having a bad day. It was so bad because he was called ugly by a good-looking guy on the train. Walking down the street in the rain, Aoi found a small, but cozy cafe, Rainy Color. He started to work part-time as he enjoyed a cup of hot chocolate he was served. Then a guy came into Rainy Color... It was Keiichi Iwase, the one who told Aoi was ugly!!??",
        "jpn": "大学一年生・都倉碧はひょんなことから喫茶店「レイニーカラー」でアルバイトをすることに。\r\nクールなイケメン岩瀬啓一。お調子者の桜木涼太。\r\n心優しいマダムキラー「レイニーカラー」マスターの古賀シオン。\r\n自由奔放すぎるオーナーの天見浩司。\r\n「レイニーカラー」で繰り広げられるハートフル・コメディ！"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Rainy Cocoa, Welcome to Rainy Color",
        "Ameiro Cocoa Rainy color e Yōkoso!",
        "雨色ココア Rainy colorへようこそ！"
    ],
